#. Description
#: ../nova-common.templates.in:8001
msgid ""
"VM instances using Neutron to handle networking retrieve their metadata "
"through the Neutron metadata agent, which serves as a proxy to the Nova "
"metadata REST API server."
msgstr ""

#. Type: password
#. Description
#: ../nova-common.templates.in:8001
